IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STRING-CONCEPT.

DATA DIVISION.
      WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-CITY      PIC X(10) VALUE "CHENNAI".
       01 WS-STATE     PIC X(10) VALUE "TAMIL NADU".
       01 WS-PINCODE   PIC X(6)  VALUE "600044".
       01 WS-ADDRESS   PIC X(30).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      STRING WS-CITY DELIMITED BY SPACE
      ", " DELIMITED BY SIZE
      WS-STATE DELIMITED BY SIZE
      ", " DELIMITED BY SIZE
      WS-PINCODE DELIMITED BY SIZE
      INTO WS-ADDRESS
      END-STRING.
      DISPLAY WS-ADDRESS.
STOP RUN.
